OL,3,GNEWSANHS Grampian scandal should be
OL,4,Awatershed moment - BMA
OL,5,
OL,6,FA series of failures in patient care at
OL,7,FNHS Grampian should be a watershed
OL,8,Fmoment, the chairwoman of the BMA in
OL,9,FScotland has said.
OL,11,FDr Nora Murray-Cavanagh said the public
OL,12,Fwere "horrified" by the revelations,
OL,13,Fbut she hoped an independent review
OL,14,Fwould uncover the truth of what
OL,15,Fhappened.
OL,17,FEarlier this month, the health watchdog
OL,18,Ffound "major deficiencies" in the
OL,19,Fhealth board's leadership and culture.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
